  "verseCount": 49,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "4",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DEU 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ichi dinu, enu aIsarela, tiyililenu yidika nawuŋaji wunukuyileja kulonda kwilamu; kulonda muhandi, mwipili muheti ituŋa dakuyinkayi Yehova Nzambi yawankakulula jenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mazu inukuyileja bayi mwakalunjikakwokuku, hela kufumishaku nehi, kulonda mwakahembaŋa chachiwahi kuleja kwambala kwaYehova Nzambi yenu kunayilejaŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu aweni munamoni namesu enu cheliliyi Yehova hansaŋu yaBayali Peyori; muloŋa mayala ejima amulondeli Bayali Peyori ayijilumwini kudi Yehova Nzambiyenu mukachi kenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa enu mwakakeleli Yehova Nzambi yenu saŋa mwahandila nilelu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Talenu ntahi, nayileji dehi yidika nawuŋaji, mwomwanlejeliyi Yehova Nzambi yami, kulonda mwakelaŋamu mwituŋa dimukuya nakuheta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwakahembaŋa chachiwahi mwakelaŋamu; muloŋa diwu maana enu nikashinshi kenu kumesu awantu ejima, chakatiya wuyidika iyi yejima, akahosha nawu, Chalala iwu muza weneni hiyantu akweti maana nakashinshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Indi kudi muza weneni wukwawu wukwetimukishi kwakwihi nawena, neyi chadiyi Yehova Nzambi yetu hejimatwa mutambikaŋa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Indi kudi muza wukwawu weneni wukweti yidi kana wuŋaji waloŋa, neyi chi loŋa nshimbiŋi jinukuyileja lelu?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chiŋa wubabalaŋa wakahembaŋa muchima weyi chachiwahi nankashi, kuchina kuvulamena yuma yiwamweni namesu eyi, yakenza kafuma kumuchima weyi nyaka yeyi yejima yiwamba kahandaŋa; wakalejaŋamu nianyaneyinianyana kawanyaneyi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "niifuku diwemeni kumesu aYehova Nzambi yeyi kuHorebi, hapililiyi Yehova, nindi, Mpompesheli antu niyileji mazu ami atiyi, kulonda adizi kuntiya woma nyaka yejima yamba kahandaŋawu hanuhamaseki, kulonda akalejaŋa anyanawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu mwaswilili kwakwihi, mwemeni kwishina dampidi; nimpidi yabidimini kesi kashikili nimukachi kewulu, kwadiŋi nimwidima, niivu, nikushishita bwi chikupu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova mwadiŋiyi mukesi hakuhosha nanenu; mwatiyili izu damazu, himwamweni chifwiki jaku, mwatiyili kwezu hohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wayishimwinini mwaya chitiyaŋenu chindi chayilejeliyi kukoŋamu, joju nshimbi ikumi; wajisonekeli kwindi hamalola awubasa ayedi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Henahana Yehova wanlejeli kuyilejayidika nawuŋaji, nindi mwakelaŋamu mwituŋa dimukuya nakuheta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi babalenu nankashi, muloŋa denodu ifuku diŋa dahosheliyi Yehova nanenu kuHorebi mukesi, himwamweni hoku chifwikijaku; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mwakenza kaditokesha tuhu bu-lu-lu nakudilila mukishi wakusoŋa wakufwikŋa mwekalilayi muntu wakwesekeja, hela iyala hela mumbanda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hela wakwesekeja kanyama hikanyama wekala hamaseki, hela wakwesekeja kajilahikajila wukweti mpuula watúukaŋa haluzwizu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hela wakwesekeja chuma hichuma chazalalaŋa hamaseki, hela wakwesekeja inshi hinshi wekala mumeji mwishina damaseki; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wakenza kafumbula mesu eyi kwiwulu, chiwakamona niitaŋwa, nikakweji, nitutumbwa, yoyileŋaleŋa yamwiwulu yejima, wakenza kakokekelamu, hiwukudifukula kudi wena, nakuyipesha, yoyumaya anjaŋeneniyi Yehova Nzambi yeyi nyuza yejima yekala mwishina dewulu dejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu Yehova nayitambuli dehi, wayifumishili mulutepulwa chikupu, mwomuEjipitu, kulonda mwakekali antu indi, wuswana windinilelu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakwila ami Yehova wanzuwilili hanyijimba yenwenu, wasanyikilinindi ami kuzambuka Yodana nehi, hela kwijila mwituŋa odu dadi wahi daku kwinkayi Yehova Nzambi yeyi dawuswana nehi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "chiŋa nifwila mwituŋa dinu, ami kutwesha kuzambuka Yodana nehi, hakwinza enu yenu mukuzambuka, mwakaheta ituŋodu dadiwahi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babalenu mwakenzakavula mena chitiyaŋenu chaYehova Nzambi yenu chatiyaŋeniyi nanenu, mwakenza kadilila mukishi wakusoŋa wakufwikŋa chuma hichuma chanakulekeshiyi Yehova Nzambi yeyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa Yehova Nzambi yeyi hikesikanoŋeshaŋa, hiNzambi wukweti mukawu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chiwakawala nyana niezukulu, neyi munakashakami delii mwituŋa hanalehi dehi, hiwakaditokesha bu-lu-lu, hiwakadilila mukishi wakusoŋa wakufwikŋa chuma hichuma, hiwakakoŋa chatama kumesu aYehova Nzambi yeyi, wumuvuloki azuwi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ami lelu hinukutambika niiwuluniiseki ekali ayinsahu enu, mwakajilumuka shati chakadi nikuleha mwituŋa dimukuya nakuheta mwishinadi daYodana; himwakashakama mwokumafuku amavuluku, mwakajilumuka tuhu shati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wakayimwaŋa ndu-ndu mwahita nyuza yawantu, omu munyuza mwakayitwalayi Yehova mwakashala antesha hohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwenoku mwakapesha akishi akutuŋana makasa awantu, anyitondu namalola, abulaŋa hela kumona, hela kutiya, hela kudya, hela kutiya ivumba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa neyi kwenoku wakamukeŋakeŋa Yehova Nzambi yeyi, wakamuwana, neyi wakamukeŋakeŋa namuchima weyiwejima, nawumi weyi wejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chiwakamona yihuŋu, niyuma yejimiyi yina kuwani dehi, hamafuku akukuminina wamba kafunta cheŋi kudi Yehova Nzambi yeyi, wamba katiyilila cheŋi izu dindi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "muloŋa Yehova Nzambi yeyi hiNzambi wawushona; hakakuumbaku, hakakujilumunaku, hakavulamena chitiyaŋenu chawankakulula jeyi chayisanyikililiyuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ihulaku ntahi mafuku anahiti dehi ásambilili, kufumisha kwifukudaleŋeliyi Nzambi muntu hanu hamaseki, kufumisha kunsa yewulu yimulusu nikunsa yi kwawu, achimonahu dehi chuma cheneni neyi ichi, achitiyahu dehi, tahindi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuduhu antu atiyahu dehi izu daNzambi diku hoshamukachi kakesi neyi chimunatiyenu, ahanda? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nzambi wesekahu dehi kuya nakutambula muza mukachi kamuza wukwawu, nakweseka, nayinjikijilu, nayihayamisha, nanjita, nachikasa chaŋovu, nachikasa chakwolola, nayuma yeneni yakufwisha mutentu, neyi mwejima mwayikoŋeleliyi Yehova Nzambi yenu muEjipitu kumesu enu, tahindi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anayilejumu enu, kulonda mwiluki nenu Yehova diyi Nzambi, hikudi wacheŋuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wahosheliizu dindi dafumini mwiwulu kulonda wuditiyi, kulonda akuleji maana; hela hanu hamaseki wakumwekesheleli kesi kindi keneni; eyi watiyili mazu indi akufuma mukachi kakesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ochu chakeŋeliyi ankakulula jeyi, dichichatondeleliyi anyanawu alondelumu, hakukufumisha nimuEjipitu, ikusaŋa ekalilayi neyi naŋovu jindi jasweja; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 4:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kulonda atemuni kuwukuyeyinyuza yakubadikeyi nikutoha niŋovu, kulonda akwiŋiji, akwinki ituŋa dawudiikali wuswana weyi, neyi ichi chimunamoni lelu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.4.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.4.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
